  *     the pool), 21 (TFE registers read), 22 (WM7 written, not enabled), 23 (enable + one frame);
+ *     0276: kern.sweet_cam_exp (exposure), op 30 preview ring (kern.sweet_cam_latest,
+ *     kern.sweet_cam_sel), 31 preview off, 32 108 MP still; op 9 also stops the stream/capture path.
  *     kern.sweet_cam_seek + kern.sweet_cam_frame: the frame in
  *     1 MB reads, kern.sweet_cam_frame_len its size.
